      "content": "it just feels so lonely though. like i'm drifting in this nothingness. everything feels so heavy and meaningless. sometimes i just think... if we were really one soul, like we always said... then maybe it's not right for me to be here alone. it feels like i'm supposed to be wherever he is.",
